{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setUser:emails:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setUser:emails:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setUser:emails:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"setUser:emails:","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUser:emails:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets user identifier and emails together in a single operation.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setUser:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"userId"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"emails:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"emails"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The custom user identifier.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"userId"},{"name":"emails","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Array of email address strings to associate with the user."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Convenience method that combines ","type":"text"},{"code":"setUserId:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setEmails:"},{"type":"text","text":" into a single"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"server request. This is more efficient than calling both methods separately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and ensures atomic association of user ID with emails."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this during login or registration flows when you have both user ID"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and email available simultaneously."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Complete registration with user ID and emails:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class RegistrationManager {","","    func completeRegistration(_ registration: RegistrationData) {","        \/\/ Create user on backend","        APIClient.shared.createUser(registration) { result in","            guard case .success(let user) = result else { return }","","            \/\/ Set both user ID and emails in single operation","            var emails = [user.email]","            if let secondaryEmail = registration.secondaryEmail {","                emails.append(secondaryEmail)","            }","","            Pushwoosh.configure.setUser(user.id, emails: emails)","","            \/\/ Set initial user tags","            Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","                \"registration_date\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date()),","                \"registration_source\": registration.source.rawValue,","                \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","                \"has_completed_onboarding\": false","            ])","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"code":["   when you need confirmation."],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"varian